# SKIMMER: the computer plays both sides (CORAL COMPUTER, TEAL AUTO with no
# pad 2), computer NORMAL, 1 VS 1, the WILD table with its two bumpers on the
# centre line, rate 60. Nobody touches anything after PLAY; TEAL scores at
# about frame 656.
# Run (from boards/desktop): pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 60 --frames 720 --script skimmer-wild.script --shot <frames> --out <folder>

# --- home screen (boot off): step right 11 tiles to SKIMMER, then start it
46 press right
47 release right
48 press right
49 release right
50 press right
51 release right
52 press right
53 release right
54 press right
55 release right
56 press right
57 release right
58 press right
59 release right
60 press right
61 release right
62 press right
63 release right
64 press right
65 release right
66 press right
67 release right
68 press south   # start SKIMMER
69 release south

